@startuml US101-SSD
autonumber
title System Sequence Diagram (SSD) - US101: Register Aircraft Model

actor "Backoffice Operator" as Operator
participant ":System" as System

activate Operator
Operator -> System: initiates the registration of a new aircraft model
activate System
System --> Operator: requests necessary data (manufacturer, model name, fuel capacity, max range, cruising speed)
deactivate System

Operator -> System: selects manufacturer and inputs the requested data
activate System
System --> Operator: confirms aircraft model registration and returns details (201 Created)
deactivate System
deactivate Operator
@enduml